---
import MarketingShell from '../layouts/MarketingShell.astro';
import { SUPPORT_CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../site';

const title = 'Community Guidelines | Echo';
const description = 'Our community guidelines for maintaining a safe and respectful environment on Echo.';
const lastUpdated = '23 March 2026';
---

<MarketingShell title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/community-guidelines">
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="legal-content">
        <header class="legal-header">
          <span class="hero-eyebrow">Legal</span>
          <h1>Community Guidelines</h1>
          <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        </header>

        <div class="legal-body">
          <p class="legal-intro">
            These guidelines set Echo's platform-wide expectations. Individual communities 
            (servers) may adopt their own stricter rules, but they cannot override platform-wide 
            safety requirements.
          </p>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>1. Expression & Conduct</h2>
            <p>
              Echo protects free expression. No one is removed simply for what they say or believe. 
              Limits apply only when expression threatens the platform's existence, disrupts its 
              operation, or prevents others from using it.
            </p>
            <p>
              Individual communities may enforce stricter standards within their own spaces.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>2. NSFW Content</h2>
            <p>NSFW content is restricted and only allowed under strict conditions:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Servers explicitly marked as 18+</li>
              <li>Private chats where all participants are confirmed 18+</li>
              <li>Groups where all members are 18+</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Any NSFW content outside these environments is not allowed.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>3. Violence & Harm</h2>
            <p>The following is strictly prohibited:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Graphic depictions of real-world violence</li>
              <li>Gore or explicit violent imagery</li>
              <li>Content that glorifies real harm</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Discussion of real-world events is allowed when non-graphic and informational.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>4. Threats & Safety Risks</h2>
            <p>
              Credible threats of violence are strictly forbidden. Any behavior interpreted as a 
              real-world threat may result in immediate enforcement action.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>5. Spam & Platform Abuse</h2>
            <p>The following behaviors are not allowed:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Spam (repeated, irrelevant, or disruptive messaging)</li>
              <li>Mass messaging or disruptive automation</li>
              <li>Server raiding or coordinated disruption attempts</li>
              <li>Self-promotion, advertising, or unsolicited marketing</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>6. Illegal Content</h2>
            <p>Content that is illegal to produce, distribute, or possess is prohibited, including:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Child sexual abuse material (CSAM)</li>
              <li>Content promoting terrorism</li>
              <li>Content that facilitates serious crimes</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>7. Harassment & Hate</h2>
            <p>
              Coordinated harassment, targeted abuse, or content that incites violence against 
              individuals or protected groups is prohibited.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>8. Privacy Violations</h2>
            <p>
              Do not share others' private information without consent. This includes doxxing, 
              sharing private messages publicly, or distributing personal data.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>9. Reporting</h2>
            <p>
              If you see content that violates these guidelines, report it using the in-app 
              reporting tools or contact <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>10. Enforcement</h2>
            <p>
              Violations may result in warnings, temporary suspensions, or permanent bans depending 
              on severity and context. We aim to be fair and proportionate in enforcement.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <footer class="legal-footer">
          <nav class="legal-nav">
            <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="/attributions">Attributions</a>
          </nav>
        </footer>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</MarketingShell>
